	)
	(text "Two Eurorack outputs J2 + J3 (+/-12V)\nMonitors, OV guard\nMAIN LED (only status LED)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 381 294.64 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.4 1.4)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "83b1cd89-6b65-5f48-90f3-7699af3b931c")
	)
	(text "OUTPUTS: +12 / -12 on J2 and J3 in parallel (pins 11/12 open)\nPublished prototype rating (S9.0): +12V 2.4 A, -12V 0.8 A, <= 33 W together,\nfrom a 15 V / 3 A (>= 45 W) USB PD source; above 2 A per rail use both headers.\nNo reverse blocking: never plug an unpowered module into a live bus."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 370.84 386.08 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.2 1.2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "844ed931-dd8b-5fbe-ba9f-76dd25cbf9c2")
	)
	(text "TPS552892-Q1 buck-boost\n+12 V, 3.14-3.53 A CC limit"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 187.96 111.76 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.4 1.4)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "95973a3a-4a93-5f39-9d77-37df7af59d27")
	)
	(text "S9.0: +5V subsystem removed; 15 V / 3 A PD input; +12V buck-boost; ceramic banks; two parallel outputs; VPD-powered OV guard (+12V / -12V); one-shot arming latch; MAIN LED only."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 25.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.2 1.2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "e63c9afc-dc99-53f6-9761-326c600e7278")
	)
	(text "FAULT POLICY\nOne-shot qualification from the first converter enable (STARTED latch); after\n0.31-0.88 s any persistent bad status -> all OFF until RESET. Severe OV via U20 acts even before ARMED.\nS9.0: ANY_BAD = NOT(MAIN_LED_OK AND P12_OK AND N12_OK); no +5V rail.\nMAIN indicates enabled/status, not precision regulation."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 370.84 340.36 0)
